      "side": 1,
      "message": "is it implied that a streams starts in paused state or the standby means paused? MMAP expects a start command after opening. In this case this would be a resume() command.\n\nGenerally speaking, wouldn\u0027t it be simpler to not add a IStreamTransportControl interface and make the resume and pause method mandatory in the IStream interface? \nI never liked the implicit start on first write after standby.",
